\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Schematic of the self-consistency loop closed in this paper (a conceptual diagram, not a data plot). A bond-phase texture fixes the BdG Hamiltonian, whose occupied eigenstates carry a ring current; that current sources a Biot-Savart self-field, which dresses the hopping bonds with an additional Peierls phase that feeds back into the texture the loop started from. The loop closes at the fixed-point condition of Eq.~(1), $\phi _{\rm  self}=G(\phi _{\rm  ext}+\phi _{\rm  self})$.}}{3}{}}
\newlabel{fig:loop}{{1}{3}{}{}{}}
