\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {I}{\ignorespaces Ensemble-averaged self-consistent boundary shift under on-site disorder, at two points bracketing the literature-realistic range, as a function of system size $N$ ($n_{\rm  real}=30$ per point). The $N=80$ values are the same ones plotted in Fig.~\ref {fig:disorder}(right); they substantially overstate the effect at $W=46\,\Delta $, which does not survive to statistical significance once $N$ is increased.}}{8}{}}
